keymaster-desktop (0.9.0-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * keymaster 0.9.0 on keyvault 0.6.0 (mission 48.3)
    - SSH, OpenPGP, MLS and X.509 keys change: Ed25519 and P-256 come
      from their own SLIP-10 roots, and the use' level is now
      variant << 8 | role. Nostr, realm and transport (secp256k1) keys
      are unchanged
    - Stored entries are migrated on first start (key-metadata.json v2,
      .pre-0.9.bak backup, key-metadata.migration-0.9.log); OpenPGP
      creation times are reset and X.509 certificates are dropped
  * keymaster 0.8.x: X.509 service (PKCS#11 client auth, CSR, import)
  * keymaster 0.7.x: multi-realm controller, one authority per key-path
    tree, per-connector state
  * keymaster 0.6.x: RFCOMM transport

 -- Rene Malmgren <duke_h3@dwdc.club>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:45:00 +0400

